			"notes": "# Large Feature Update\nHello! It's definitely been a while since the last time I updated the mod, there's been some huge changes though!\n\n - Version bump from v1.5.1 to v1.6.0\n - Added a feature that let's you convert multiple Flashback recordings and then merge them into one singular world per the request of PearITX2: [Suggestion #1](https://discord.com/channels/1538974477407232021/1546585984647307396/1546585984647307396)\n - Added a feature that lets you convert a Flashback recording and import the chunks directly into another singleplayer world.\n\nCredits to PearITX2 for the convert multiple Flashback recordings and then merge into one singular world feature. It came from his fork of my mod."
		},
